<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italian 10-yr BTP sale.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italian 10-yr BTP sale.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a 19th tranche of 1.5 trillion lire of 10-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (BTP) carrying a 6.75 percent coupon.</p>
<p>		   February 1, 2007   previous</p>
<p> Net Yield	 6.10 pct vs	6.40 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield     6.99 pct vs	7.30 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price 99.10     vs     97.00</p>
<p> Bids		 3.215 trillion lire</p>
<p> Assigned	   1.500 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with a previous auction of a 17th tranche of the 10-year BTP on May 29.</p>
</text>
